<div class="chapter_content content" id="7682384_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 by L.L. No. 2-1983 as Ch. IXB of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Freshwater wetlands — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7682544" href="7682544#7682544">203</a>.</div><div class="para">Pollution — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683870" href="7683870#7683870">267</a>.</div><div class="para">Zoning — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


